# requests/admin.http
#
# WHAT THIS IS
# Tests for B6: the admin API.
# The password comes from requests/.env (ignored by git), never this file.
# REST Client remembers cookies like a browser, so after test 3 logs in,
# the tests after it are logged in too.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Not logged in → expect 401 "Log in to see this."
GET {{base}}/api/admin/me

### 2. Wrong password → expect 401 "Wrong password."
POST {{base}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "definitely-not-it" }

### 3. Right password → expect 200, and a "set-cookie: sd_admin=..." header
# @prompt password Your admin password (from .env.local)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "{{password}}" }
### 4. Logged in now → expect 200 { "ok": true }
GET {{base}}/api/admin/me

### 5. Log out → expect 200
POST {{base}}/api/admin/logout

### 6. Logged out again → expect 401
GET {{base}}/api/admin/me


# ── DATA (send test 3 first to log in again: test 5 logged you out) ──

### 7. Headline numbers → expect 200
GET {{base}}/api/admin/overview

### 8. Graph data, last 30 days → expect 200, "daily" has 30 entries
GET {{base}}/api/admin/charts

### 9. Graph data, last 7 days → expect 200, "daily" has 7 entries
GET {{base}}/api/admin/charts?days=7

### 10. Silly range → expect 400 "days must be a number from 7 to 365."
GET {{base}}/api/admin/charts?days=2


# ── PEOPLE (log in with test 3 first if you restarted the server) ──

### 11. The big table, newest first → expect 200, total 30
GET {{base}}/api/admin/signups

### 12. Only flagged people → expect total 3 (IP Seven, Human One, Human Two)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/signups?flagged=yes

### 13. Search → expect total 1 (Alpha)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/signups?search=alpha

### 14. Prospects, most recruits first → expect Alpha, Bravo, Charlie at the top
GET {{base}}/api/admin/signups?role=prospect&sort=recruits&pageSize=10

### 15. Bad filter → expect 400 "Check the filters."
GET {{base}}/api/admin/signups?role=admin

### 16. Alpha's person page → expect 4 recruits (A1-A4)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/signups/27

### 17. Disqualify Alpha (a test!) → expect "disqualified": true
PATCH {{base}}/api/admin/signups/27
Content-Type: application/json

{ "disqualified": true, "reason": "Testing disqualify", "note": "Just a test" }

### 18. PUBLIC stats → expect count 26 (was 27) and Bravo now #1, Alpha gone
GET {{base}}/api/stats

### 19. Admin leaderboard → Bravo rank 1, Alpha listed with rank null
GET {{base}}/api/admin/leaderboard

### 20. Reinstate Alpha + clear the note → expect "disqualified": false
PATCH {{base}}/api/admin/signups/27
Content-Type: application/json

{ "disqualified": false, "note": "" }

### 21. Red flags → expect 1 IP group of 3 (IP Seven, Human One, Human Two)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/flags

### 22. Delete WITHOUT confirming → expect 400
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/signups/42

### 23. Delete Plus Dot (test data) → expect 200 { "deleted": 42 }
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/signups/42
Content-Type: application/json

{ "confirm": true }

### 24. Spreadsheet download → expect CSV text, one line per person
GET {{base}}/api/admin/export